{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0263_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7519bb57b8fa7562d1f805891fe4823cd6769be117d0163ff4e2d0f5147e66a4", "ja": "（勇者役を演じる事になり、百合子は嬉しそうだった。\n気合いの入り方も、いつもと違ってた気が……）", "zh": "（得知自己要出演勇者，百合子似乎很开心。\n感觉她投入的干劲也和平时不太一样……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0263_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "69561ffcd8350f8b076b7fd8431ff78577ef8c8168b163e790ff805b20c09873", "ja": "……はーち！　きゅ～う！　じゅ～～う！\nはあ～。う、腕が……。", "zh": "……八——！　九～～！　十～～～！\n哈啊～。胳、胳膊好酸……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0263_1002_p", "source_sha256": "34e6653c191f3ca447773bad1c91fa7264e7cc740ac3adbc7264f65d98ac4df1", "ja": "ん？　この声は、百合子？", "zh": "嗯？这个声音是百合子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0263_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "190e95618411a2cccd60a30b02b07308c920cff6f70958d5639824e43f731011", "ja": "ううん。本物の勇者なら……リリィナイトなら、\nこんなことで諦めたりしない……うん。", "zh": "不对。真正的勇者……莉莉骑士，是不会因为这种事就放弃的……嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0263_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a5fb0ea61d49306d3242733d3ac18c913890bd74e1d97009ee15ea9f791fadb3", "ja": "お疲れ様、百合子。\nこんなとこで何を……。", "zh": "辛苦了，百合子。\n你在这种地方做什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0263_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "1a530abe7427a4a7c71e1bb33e69f2f354996753c6dbd348b7db925105afe773", "ja": "ひゃあっ！　{$P$}さん！？\nど、どうしてここに？", "zh": "呀啊！{$P$}先生！？\n你、你怎么会在这里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0263_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a39c31b36db5dd10117764df39ff81c3be74e4593f327018f27f116fe69b0947", "ja": "いや、声が聞こえたから気になったんだけど。\nそれよりも衣装……。", "zh": "没有，听到声音有点在意就过来了。\n比起这个，那件服装……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0263_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "ce728de6278e6a06525a68788f2a5a20677ed4e3e2ecb4b15096e2569480cb8f", "ja": "ああ～……ご、ごめんなさい！\n勝手に衣装を持ち出しちゃって……。", "zh": "啊啊～……对、对不起！\n我擅自把服装拿出来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0263_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "925c021015efc688341c4b6540f4b4d2bf851ab425c9406b9683e5b06f55942c", "ja": "少しでも勇者に近づきたくて、特訓をしてたんです。\n格好から入ってみたら、すごくやる気が出てきて……。", "zh": "我想哪怕能多贴近勇者一点也好，所以刚才在特训。\n试着从装扮开始入手后，就变得特别有干劲了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0263_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4829cb036b8f8225b17235c88d0f3c24f23144dc477cbac9a1a85a25d17a59de", "ja": "それで、レッスンルームで特訓してたのか。\n苦しそうな声だったけど、何の練習をしてたんだ？", "zh": "所以，你才在练习室里特训啊。\n听起来声音挺痛苦的，你到底在练什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0263_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "e70320ae5f623f205271939c6cf07d39b38445d74b2c49d4e9b3412a1c429127", "ja": "今日は剣の素振りです！　この前、杏奈ちゃんが\n「撮影用の剣は重い」って教えてくれたんです。", "zh": "今天练习挥剑！前些天，杏奈告诉我：“拍摄用的剑很重。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0263_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "31477e4e28bef4834d88ad0f2bb60af9b49a03ea8d7e9a6b7d2fb5721b0a7850", "ja": "私、体力には自信がありません。でも勇者ですから！\nちゃんと剣の扱いもマスターしてみせます！", "zh": "我对体力没什么自信。但我可是勇者！\n一定会好好掌握剑术的，请看我的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0263_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6beab0a95913f6a926ef77fc6851f70b9425080ba9ac4b3f1b3ae1d83a962d86", "ja": "なるほど。そういうことなら俺も付き合うよ。\nといっても、見ているくらいだけど。", "zh": "原来如此。既然这样，我也陪你一起吧。\n不过，也就只能在旁边看着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0263_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "c670674d6e9e871e02b94df62a4216ed6269fbabc1ec30d3a9b12a0c06011c86", "ja": "えっ、いいんですか、{$P$}さん？\nお忙しいんじゃ……？", "zh": "诶，可以吗，{$P$}先生？\n您不是很忙吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0263_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a3f572934b225fe8a7fd43b5684630efb52f649edc472af07a5624a4341e3da3", "ja": "大丈夫だ。勇者の成長を見守るのも、\nプロデューサーの仕事だからな！", "zh": "没关系。守护勇者的成长，\n也是制作人的工作啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0263_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "66567324bb2e74bd06d5c00326f29a806e8c14d981c66bf320d20a14ce0189f0", "ja": "えへへ……ありがとうございます！\nひとりで練習するの、寂しいなって思ってたんです。", "zh": "嘿嘿……谢谢您！\n我本来觉得一个人练习挺寂寞的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0263_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "59e01febf118d1d472e92143ae9075f18440258e61384736e2ad32dc8b880200", "ja": "それではお言葉に甘えて。\n修行の続きを始めましょう！　次は必殺技を……！", "zh": "那我就恭敬不如从命了。\n继续修行吧！接下来是必杀技……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0263_1017_p", "source_sha256": "632e407596248045b431a9ea46dc5f71c7b124584c97eefc64ce1e1123b69ef5", "ja": "（地道な特訓の成果もあって、作品はいいものに\n仕上がった！　モチベーションは本当に大事だな）", "zh": "（多亏了脚踏实地的特训成果，作品完成得很不错！干劲真的很重要啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
